Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:30.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Good morning, Prince-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.12,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:38.97,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hello to you too, goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.86,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Morning chores complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:49.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}They still haven't contacted me about my coord,{lit- They haven't contacted me about my coord since then, }
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:51.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I suppose{wonder} they're not done with it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't wait to début!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,Tel,0,0,0,,{[TEL]}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:56.54,Default,Fuwaru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:02.09,Default,Fuwaru,0,0,0,,This box Toriko-san gave me makes sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:06.47,Default,Fuwaru,0,0,0,,It's singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:13.79,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Fuwari's coord is done, but she's not picking up her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.79,0:01:16.52,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's because she's ignoring me-tori!{Is she really trying to avoid me-tori?}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.02,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That's it! Has to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:21.98,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That's got to be why!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.94,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Fuwari dances! Her first concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:03:00.22,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Have you adjusted to school life yet, Midorikaze-san?{lit- become adjusted to school a little bit}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:02.17,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:05.84,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,This goat sure has become{orig: is} a big fan of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.13,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:10.01,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A place that hasn't been immersed in city life would be good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:13.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,No, I want to get used to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:16.18,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I've found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.40,Default,All,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:21.61,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It's time for your Princess lessons, Midorikaze-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.52,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.42,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh! Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:25.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.52,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Princess lessons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:31.85,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama is expecting big things from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:38.66,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,However, it takes more than simply taking first in the PriPara GranPrix to be a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.91,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It takes heart, technique, and physique!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:48.13,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That is to say a real Princess is one who wholeheartedly wishes to achieve the pinnacle of femininity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:53.34,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,And in order to master this{your elegant figure}, Princess lessons are required.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,G-Good luck, Fuwari{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:56.93,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Manaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.21,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Your shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.21,0:04:01.02,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Walking on the backstay is a classic example of bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:01.58,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:05.27,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It appears I need to also thoroughly drill some manners into you.{or to drive into - beyond just "teach" but like drive the point home -TL}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:06.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:08.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I was just in a hurry this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.78,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I normally wear them pro{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:13.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Paprika Academy rule number 1315:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:16.41,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Even if you normally do it properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:20.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,it doesn't mean you can walk on the backstay just because you're in a rush"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.96,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Now then, let us begin your Princess lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:31.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:33.39,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Manaka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.05,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:37.50,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to use "capisce" during Princess lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:43.77,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,When responding, the two of you should use{answer with} the proper "yes, ma'am".{or some very proper and elegant way of saying something like please treat me well / take care of me / please go ahead / it'd be a pleasure -TL}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:44.82,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:47.48,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I said use "yes, ma'am"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:48.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ye...{よ…｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:51.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.{よろしくってよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Of course, ma'am.{およろしくってよ｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:53.91,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We'd be glad to.{で ございますわよ｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yes, we'd be of course to.{よござんすですよ｡}{These 3 lines are nonsense so feel free to be a little silly.-krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.50,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We'll yes, ma'am.{おそろしくってよ｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.88,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,We'll yes, we'd be ma'am, glad to.{おろよろしくしくですってよ｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.40,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Quit screwing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.63,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!{よ… よろしくってよ｡}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.04,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.14,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,We'll start with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:13.82,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,As a Princess, you are expected to dance in high heels at a party.{You must be able to attend a party and dance in high heels to be a Princess.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:15.44,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Yes, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.76,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,What's with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.89,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You must stand up straight and elegantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.85,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Yes, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:24.71,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:28.61,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Now onto the tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:33.86,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Being able to stay composed and maintain a cool smile even when wearing a heavy tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:34.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:37.27,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,...is a must for a Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:41.25,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Ye... Ye...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.83,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Yes, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:46.45,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Now then, keep that posture as we start the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.16,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:53.96,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,A PriPara Princess must worry about fashion above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:59.63,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,As such, we'll be going over some PriPara Trivia concerning coords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.47,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,Yes, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:05.19,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,This China Rock Coord has a certain animal attached to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:06.56,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,What is that animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dressing Parfait wore that coord...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's see... what animal was it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:15.11,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Here's a hint: It's black and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.11,0:06:17.08,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I got it! It's a German cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:20.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's see, black and white... black and white...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A penguin! Or zebra?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:25.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The Suffolk is a species of sheep that's also black and white.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:27.54,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Those are all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:28.78,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Next hint:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:29.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We're continuing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:32.63,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It's a cute and popular animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:34.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:35.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A tapir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.51,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You hear cute and that's what you think!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:40.09,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It is! All animals are cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:43.07,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,We don't need that kind of thinking here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:45.15,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,This cute animal is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.74,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,And there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.17,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,A panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,P-P-Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. A panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:54.86,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We don't have those in the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.70,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You're tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.52,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.61,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,When it comes to table manners,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:05.78,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,a Princess who can use chopsticks is considered elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:09.90,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,These chopstick corrective casts will whip you into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Torture? Isn't this torture?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:14.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But it looks so good...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:17.59,Default,Lawari,0,0,0,,We shall partake in this wonderful food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:25.51,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You must have good posture while eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:27.26,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Don't grasp your chopsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:28.51,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Don't hold them in your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:30.09,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Don't bring the plate to your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:31.48,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Don't lose your chopsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.27,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Even if food{taro specifically} slips away, don't stab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:34.02,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Don't drop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.44,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Don't eat like a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:36.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:39.73,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Once you're done eating, put your chopsticks on the chopstick rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:40.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Pushushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:44.39,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, you're a handful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:44.82,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:46.99,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Where's Midorikaze-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:50.21,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,She must have ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:07:57.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,High heels sure are rough on the feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:03.21,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Since I always ran around the mountains barefoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:05.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,it'll take a while to get used to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:09.71,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Princess lessons are tougher than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:14.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But everyone came to see me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.85,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,So I have to become a wonderful Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're all doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:24.15,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I can't see the mountains or sky from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if everyone's doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.61,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The young swallows in that nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:33.05,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've learned how to fly yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:36.84,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The small squirrels in the forest and the rabbits in the grasslands,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:38.77,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're doing right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:45.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's too soon to be homesick, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:47.80,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Midorikaze-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:49.76,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:51.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's Ookanda-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:56.31,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:11.99,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Are you unharmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:15.24,Default,Fuwaro,0,0,0,,P-Prince-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:19.29,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,It's Hibiki-sama! How lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.29,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:21.38,Default-Alt,Rand3,0,0,0,,Okay, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.66,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,To fly down like a goddess...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.51,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Just what part of the heavens are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.19,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:32.97,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I thought I might be able to see the Palps if I climbed to the top of that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:35.23,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Homesick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:42.67,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You are the one expected to win the Summer Dream Idol GranPrix and become the Dream Parade Princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:46.03,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,in other words the ultimate Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:50.64,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I knew you had the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.59,0:09:55.83,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I look forward to your growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.16,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.16,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.54,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.00,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,J-Just where did she go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:04.21,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Did I go a bit overboard with the training?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:04.87,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.42,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.23,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll do my best with the Princess lessons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:12.14,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Please be more strict with me, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.16,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:15.23,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Proper response!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:18.60,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,Tel,0,0,0,,{[TEL]}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:20.08,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:23.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This song again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari-chan, that's a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:26.94,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:29.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Press that and then say "hello".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:32.30,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hello! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:32.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,H-Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.37,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,She finally answered-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.37,0:10:38.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Geez! Toriko has become quite a handful! It's troublesome-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.03,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,After all, Toriko is unwanted-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:44.46,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I should set off to the mascot graveyard-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:48.67,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,She completely lost her cool when you continually ignored her call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.65,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wasn't ignoring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:53.48,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I didn't know how to use a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.05,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:57.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't think about it earlier, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:01.94,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san is my very, very precious manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.38,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.49,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Thank tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.05,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you right away-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:10.45,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Your new brand is finally done-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:12.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:12.72,Default-Alt,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.49,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,It's finally time for your début concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.49,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's finally time for my début concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:31.88,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Cosmic hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:34.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Fuwari-san, thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:37.44,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Congratulations on the start of a new brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,New brand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.98,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Here, try pulling on this ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:44.56,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:56.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Coco Flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.13,0:11:57.35,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.35,0:12:00.62,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,I used Fuwari-chan's image and created the new brand Coco Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:08.43,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,It's a brand that focuses on using natural materials while adding a novel arrangement to a cute country motif.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:11.88,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,It has completely revolutionized the PriPara Fashion world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.13,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:14.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:19.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And with that, CoCo Flower has opened a new store in PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:21.06,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:22.35,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:25.82,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Here's a PriTicket for the Tyrolean Fleur Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:28.17,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:30.32,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Now go put everything you've got into your PriPara Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:33.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:51.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,PriPara Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:53.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,Goat,0,0,0,,{goatness}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.13,0:12:56.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're super cute, Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:02.89,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How lucky! I want a new brand, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:12.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:14.04,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That coord...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:16.31,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That coord looks perfect on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:17.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:23.64,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Mega-niisan should be sending you your debut song "This Song Tomareihi" soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:31.73,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:35.55,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It's like your Birthday and Christmas presents have been rolled into one-tori!{says Bon and New Years but Jake localized it because we don't get gifts on those days - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:36.22,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:38.51,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I'm sure after all this happiness something unfortunate will...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:42.68,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,An assortment of Friday the 13th, your most unlucky day, and the armageddon will come-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:45.44,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,Lord have mercy on us. Please lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:45.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.27,0:13:49.44,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan will take pudding and curry udon-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:50.86,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:53.63,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,To celebrate the opening of Coco Flower,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:56.67,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,we will be selling pudding a la mode for a limited time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:58.43,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Coco Flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:13:59.66,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,What's that-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:04.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's a new brand created from Midorikaze Fuwari-san's image.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:09.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 259, section 5151:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"When the ultimate Princess appears,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:15.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,the demon's grand power shall be demonstrated."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:18.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Fuwari, the one who currently basks in everyone's attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:22.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I shall do whatever it takes to draw thee into Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:26.97,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Then, Mikan will take 25 of those limited Coco Flower parfaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:28.06,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:28.06,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:31.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm reluctant to part with the final note in my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:34.02,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She's broke-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:37.41,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Good luck with your début concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:38.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Make sure to put everything into your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:40.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Tension max!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.24,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:43.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Look, Fuwari,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:47.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,it's best to sing like you're trying to convey your feelings to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:50.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,If you do that, you can put more energy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:55.34,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Convey my feelings... to someone...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:01.70,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:04.22,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I absolutely won't let you enter-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.62,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Think about it-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:07.02,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,If you decide to do your début concert now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.63,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,things like make a misstep,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:09.74,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,forget the lyrics,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.23,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,accidentally drop the microphone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:14.86,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,and having the set fall down like a comedy skit are bound to happen-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:17.53,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,If that happens, there will be a storm of boos from the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:20.63,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You'll be heckled, eggs will be thrown, people will talk about you behind your back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.79,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,and you'll absolutely, completely, and undoubtedly regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:24.41,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You sure are a noisy manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:26.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you're too cowardly people will call you a chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:28.83,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I am a chicken-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:31.93,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,You should just prepare an absolutely delicious meal of deep fried Toriko and vegetables...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:34.58,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,...garnished with a potato and carrot glaze topped with tarter sauce-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.54,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It'll be delicious-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Y-You're super annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:40.94,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Here, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:42.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Take this Cyalume Charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:44.43,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:44.43,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hey, stop-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.43,0:15:45.93,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,No, don't do it-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:50.30,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Toriko! You need to properly put in her entry-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:56.77,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,But it's been so long since Toriko has entered anyone she forgot how-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.06,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:00.79,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Entry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.31,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It's not possible-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.31,0:16:03.95,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Of course it's impossible-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:05.83,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Your entry has been accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:06.99,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The leaf isn't needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:07.49,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:10.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.08,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Fuwari...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:14.47,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:16.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It'll be fine, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:19.04,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll make it a complete success.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:22.37,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Cheer for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:29.60,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Good luck with your first concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:32.63,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:34.26,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,Go for it, Fuwari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.14,Default,Fan3,0,0,0,,Congrats on your début!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:38.61,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.96,Default-Alt,Director,0,0,0,,You should do it more like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:45.06,Default-Alt,Director,0,0,0,,And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:45.47,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.47,0:16:46.28,Default-Alt,Director,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:49.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:55.31,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:13.33,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A mysterious spring orchestra!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:17.33,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:51.74,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That was the best "Yes, ma'am"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:54.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:04.53,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't too bad for her début.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:07.88,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Ah, Shikyouin-san's up, but I guess he's not ready yet..
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.45,0:19:13.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The green glow indicates a natural type.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:16.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is also the first time I've seen this colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.02,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,She has also jumped up the rankings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:21.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,She made it all the way to Newbie Idol in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.65,Default,All,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:31.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You blew it out of the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:33.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That concert was just like you-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:37.37,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You have a voice that makes me feel like a child again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:38.87,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:43.17,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I tried to show off the feelings of the Palps, my beloved home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:45.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I was nervous, but I had a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:47.00,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:47.88,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:48.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:52.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Join SoLaMi Smile and aim to win the Summer Dream GranPrix with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:53.97,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.97,0:19:57.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Fuwari is joining Dressing Parfait, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:58.47,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:19:59.85,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:01.22,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Dressing Parfait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:02.06,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,SoLaMi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:02.66,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Dressing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:03.14,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,SoLa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:03.46,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Dres!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:03.89,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,SoLa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:04.27,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Dres!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:04.64,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,SoLa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:05.02,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Dres!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:05.35,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,SoLa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:08.57,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,The team Fuwari will join,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:09.87,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:13.73,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko thinks it should be decided by her manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:14.40,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,Tel,0,0,0,,{[TEL]}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:18.70,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:20.62,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,H-Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:24.18,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I watched Fuwari's concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:27.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Thank you for guiding her, Miss Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:30.34,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,No, no, no! I did nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:36.18,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,However, let's change the song's Making Drama for her next concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:39.23,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Please make sure she's ready by the GranPrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{wa!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,PurpleGoat,0,0,0,,{goat noises}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:02.24,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This purple goat is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.29,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:09.20,Default,Fubiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Congragulations on your debut concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:11.97,Default,Fubiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since you're a bit homesick,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:14.76,Default,Fubiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll give you this Royal Imperial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:18.51,Default,Fubiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Truly yours, Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:30.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to become an elegant Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:32.79,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Please wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:08.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why?! Why?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What do you mean we're prohibited from doing PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.91,0:23:13.38,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What? I didn't hear anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.38,0:23:15.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ack! Principal Ookanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.09,0:23:16.85,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,How delightful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:18.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,She's after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:20.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This is the same as a year ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.97,0:23:22.38,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:24.69,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Well go to PriPara and perform no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:25.43,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:26.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:29.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,PriPara is for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:29.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:32.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,PriPara Has Been Outlawed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.07,0:23:33.40,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:34.81,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:36.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,
